==Drops==
===Currency shards===
Harbingers drop primarily currency [[shards]]. Shards from Harbingers are not affected by modifiers to [[Item quantity|Item Quantity]] - either from the player<ref>https://discord.com/channels/991073626721763429/991092200957952152/1050366539443998720</ref> or area modifiers<ref>https://discord.com/channels/991073626721763429/991092701837525052/1059717695999840336</ref><sup>(tested by [[Prohibited Library (community)|Prohibited Library]])</sup>. Item quantity does apply in maps with the {{c|enchanted|Items found in Areas are replaced by stacks of Currency Shards}} [[Kirac mission]] enchant, as it is considered an item conversion effect. Modifiers to item rarity do not affect currency shards in either case. 

{{il|Maven's Chisel of Avarice}}'s "More Currency" stat does not appear to affect currency shard drops from Harbingers.

